        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: தருணம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தருணம் — taruṇam — \"a moment; an occasion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அது என் வாழ்க்கையின் மிக மகிழ்ச்சியான தருணம். atu eṉ vāḻkkaiyiṉ mika makiḻcciyāṉa taruṇam. That was the happiest moment of my life."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the right moment: சரியான தருணம் (taruṇam)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தருணம் (taruṇam), \"a moment, an occasion\", is a learned Tamil word whose origin is not settled in the sources at hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
