          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நினைவுகூர் — niṉaivukūr — \"to recall; to remember\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தாத்தா தன் பள்ளி நாட்களை நினைவுகூர்ந்தார். tāttā taṉ paḷḷi nāṭkaḷai niṉaivukūrntār. Grandfather recalled his school days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): நினைவுகூர்ந்தேன், niṉaivukūrntēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A written word; in speech நினைத்துப் பார், to think back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நினைவுகூர் (niṉaivukūr) is a Tamil compound built from நினைவு, \"remembrance\" (DEDR 3683), and கூர்: DEDR has கூர், \"to be sharp, keen\" (DEDR 1898), and கூர், \"to abound\" (DEDR 1899), and which of them is in this compound is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
